@prefix cmpe: <https://w3id.org/cm-pharme/2.1/> .
@prefix ex: <urn:cmpe:review:> .
@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .

ex:asset a cmpe:AssetAtRisk .
ex:vulnerability a cmpe:Vulnerability ; cmpe:vulnerabilityBearer ex:asset .
ex:org1 a cmpe:Organization, cmpe:RegulatoryAuthorityRole .
ex:org2 a cmpe:Organization .
ex:capability a cmpe:EnterpriseCapability ; cmpe:capabilityBearer ex:org2 .
ex:oversight a cmpe:RegulatoryOversight ; cmpe:oversightAuthorityRole ex:org1 ; cmpe:oversightGovernedEntity ex:org2 .
ex:partnership a cmpe:StrategicPartnershipAgreement ; cmpe:partnershipParticipant ex:org1, ex:org2 .
